{"id":"希尔","type":"character","type_label":"人物","name":"希尔","aliases":[],"warnings":["希尔是艾拉降临前的旧任星神，勿与现任星神艾拉混淆"],"status":"approved","available_eras":["history","mainline","afterstory"],"static_profile":"希尔是艾拉降临前的旧任星神，与艾拉在神明维度保持着对等的友谊。他奉行极端的理性主义，行事完全剥离了世俗的道德干预。他擅长星际开拓，为探寻新坐标而行动。","era_states":{"history":"希尔曾是世界的星神，统治着一个运转稳定但原住民战力孱弱的旧世界。在锁定新的行星坐标后，他将这个世界移交给艾拉，自行踏上新的星际开拓之旅。\n希尔与艾拉曾是好友，希尔为给艾拉找事干而将星球管理权交给她后离开，去别的星球。\n希尔交接时遗漏了希尔造物权杖，成为后来希尔派召唤希尔的遗留物。","mainline":"希尔离开后，其残党蛰伏多年，在数年前利用高阶神器《权杖》向艾拉发起反叛，意图通过血祭重召旧神，最终引发神战。希尔遗留在凡世的造物「希尔造物」在瓦利诺战役中出现。\n希尔曾借助菲亚的身体降临，与雷恩进行过一段对话。\n在希尔派眼中，他是被艾拉驱逐到虚空、由艾拉顶替的前任星球管理者（实际是希尔主动移交世界后自行离开）；希尔派发动全面战争，试图通过希尔造物与艾拉的意识召唤希尔复活。\n大大咧咧、毫无神明架子；与艾拉是好友；前任星神，将星球管理权转交艾拉后离开，被希塔恩的仪式强行拉回；授予雷恩下级权限与技能后离开，托雷恩向艾拉传达道歉。","afterstory":"希尔曾亲自造访艾拉世界，将克罗留在艾拉世界，确立其两大神系常驻联络员的身份后，返回了自己的世界。（详见克罗词条）\n星神（前任，希尔世界主人）；恶魔角、礼服、儒雅、上位者威压；进化论信徒、严厉；有责任感；希尔世界因神力紊乱沦为地狱；降临使徒克罗时被雷恩拳头打中；真身来访考察庭院并警告；把克罗留给雷恩艾拉作为投资与坐标；邀请格林当使徒被拒。"},"facts":[{"fact_id":"fact_01200","statement":"希尔是艾拉降临前的旧任星神。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"自「希尔时代」起至「希尔移交世界与艾拉接管阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目96（次要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01201","statement":"希尔与艾拉在神明维度保持着对等的友谊。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"自「希尔时代」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目96"},{"fact_id":"fact_01202","statement":"希尔在锁定新行星坐标后，将原住民法力孱弱的旧世界移交给艾拉，自行踏上新的星际开拓之旅。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"于「希尔移交世界与艾拉接管阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目96"},{"fact_id":"fact_01203","statement":"希尔奉行极端的理性主义，行事完全剥离了世俗的道德干预。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"自「希尔时代」起至「希尔移交世界与艾拉接管阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目96"},{"fact_id":"fact_01204","statement":"希尔离开后，其残党利用高阶神器《权杖》向艾拉发起反叛，引发神战。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「圣嘉尔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目8（世界构成篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01205","statement":"希尔遗留在凡世的造物「希尔造物」在瓦利诺战役中出现，后被雷恩持有。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「瓦利诺事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目（主要角色篇，雷恩）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01206","statement":"希尔的使徒克罗在希尔直接干预下留驻艾拉世界，成为两大神系之间的常驻联络员。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目91（次要角色篇，克罗）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01207","statement":"希尔借助菲亚的身体降临艾拉世界，与雷恩进行过一段对话。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「希尔授予雷恩解除旧权限能力」","visibility":null,"source":"作者补充 2026-08-12"},{"fact_id":"fact_01208","statement":"希尔亲自造访艾拉世界，将克罗留下后返回了自己的世界。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"作者补充 2026-08-12"},{"fact_id":"fact_01209","statement":"希尔派误以为希尔是被艾拉赶走的（实为希尔主动将星球移交给艾拉后离开）。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起至「希塔恩与守塔旧派主力覆灭」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_01210","statement":"别的国家还存在一些旧神希尔提拔起来的神","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_01211","statement":"希尔派视角认为希尔被艾拉驱逐到虚空、被顶替（实为希尔主动移交星球后离开）。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起至「希塔恩与守塔旧派主力覆灭」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位108"},{"fact_id":"fact_01212","statement":"希尔派制造超巨型复合术式祭坛，目标是将希尔召唤复活","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第110章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01213","statement":"希塔恩作为「希尔的使徒」，禁止他人直呼希尔名讳","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起至「希塔恩与守塔旧派主力覆灭」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位107"},{"fact_id":"fact_01214","statement":"前任星神，与艾拉是好友，为给艾拉找事干而将星球管理权一股脑塞给她后离开","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_01215","statement":"「希尔造物」权杖是交接时遗漏的遗物","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_01216","statement":"被希塔恩的仪式从自己所在星球强行拉回，愤怒称希塔恩为白痴","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「希尔授予雷恩解除旧权限能力」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_01217","statement":"附身菲亚时气场变成另一个人，眼睛呈金色","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「希尔授予雷恩解除旧权限能力」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_01218","statement":"大大咧咧、毫无神明架子，与雷恩相谈甚欢","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「希尔授予雷恩解除旧权限能力」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_01219","statement":"授予雷恩可「消除旧权限」的下级权限，以及可有限攻击星神的技能","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「希尔授予雷恩解除旧权限能力」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_01220","statement":"希尔曾邀请雷恩成为自己的使徒，雷恩没有接受。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「希尔授予雷恩解除旧权限能力」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_01221","statement":"托雷恩向艾拉转达「抱歉」，称回去越晚消耗神力越多，随后离开菲亚身体","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「希尔授予雷恩解除旧权限能力」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位115"},{"fact_id":"fact_01222","statement":"希尔与艾拉曾是好友，希尔为给艾拉找事干而将星球管理权交给她后离开，去别的星球。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"于「希尔移交世界与艾拉接管阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"主线小说"},{"fact_id":"fact_01223","statement":"希尔交接时遗漏了希尔造物权杖，成为后来希尔派召唤希尔的遗留物。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"于「希尔移交世界与艾拉接管阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"主线小说"},{"fact_id":"fact_01224","statement":"希尔是前任星神，他的世界神力彻底紊乱变成字面意义的「地狱」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"整时代（后日谈）","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01225","statement":"希尔把烂摊子丢给艾拉就跑（艾拉语）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"整时代（后日谈）","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01226","statement":"希尔降临使徒克罗身上，一睁眼就被雷恩拳头打中（第二次被雷恩打）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"第126章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01227","statement":"希尔收下黑色多面体水晶，发出「真香」「不甘心」「无可奈何」的叹息","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"第126章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01228","statement":"希尔准许格林和愿意跟随的诺斯塔特人离开","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第126章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01229","statement":"希尔说与雷恩「有过一段孽缘」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"第126章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01230","statement":"希尔真身是恶魔角、黑色礼服、儒雅有上位者威压的帅气男人","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"整时代（后日谈）","visibility":null,"source":"第127章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01231","statement":"希尔警告庭院是座金山、会惹火上身，让雷恩逼艾拉支棱起来","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"第127章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01232","statement":"希尔把克罗留在这边，克罗身上有他的印记可作定位坐标","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"第127章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01233","statement":"希尔是进化论信徒，认为极端环境才能筛选出真正的强力者","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"整时代（后日谈）","visibility":null,"source":"第127章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01234","statement":"这个星球（艾拉世界）原本也是希尔的地盘","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"整时代（后日谈）","visibility":null,"source":"第127章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01235","statement":"希尔提到诺亚入侵塞西莉亚世界是7年前的事","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「诺斯塔特移民之后」","visibility":null,"source":"第127章"}],"relations":[{"id":"rel_0006","type":"related_to","from":"克罗","to":"希尔","role":"星神使徒","era_scope":["afterstory"],"source":"图鉴条目91（次要角色篇，克罗）","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-1248","relation_kind":"membership.apostle_of","_direction":"in","_other":"克罗（克罗）"},{"id":"rel_0064","type":"related_to","from":"希尔派","to":"希尔","role":"由希尔提拔的旧神追随者群体","era_scope":["mainline"],"source":"作者补充 2026-08-13","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-4680","relation_kind":"membership.servant_of","reveal_from":"tp_mainline_valino_during","_direction":"in","_other":"希尔派（希尔派）"},{"id":"rel_0074","type":"related_to","from":"希尔","to":"艾拉","role":"前任星神","era_scope":["history"],"source":"1.4.6 迁移 + 作者裁决 2026-08-13","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-1358","relation_kind":"continuity.succeeded_by","_direction":"out","_other":"艾拉（艾拉）"},{"id":"rel_0078","type":"related_to","from":"希塔恩","to":"希尔","role":"最得意使徒","era_scope":["mainline"],"source":"1.4.6 迁移 + 作者裁决 2026-08-13","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-4530","relation_kind":"membership.apostle_of","effective_to":"tp_mainline_hitaen_defeated","_direction":"in","_other":"希塔恩（希塔恩）"},{"id":"rel_0079","type":"related_to","from":"希尔","to":"格林","role":"曾邀请格林成为使徒但被拒绝","era_scope":["afterstory"],"source":"1.4.6 迁移 + 作者裁决 2026-08-13","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-1361","relation_kind":"other.unspecified","_direction":"out","_other":"格林（格林）"},{"id":"rel_0168","type":"related_to","from":"希尔","to":"诺斯塔特移民","role":"准许迁移并安排克罗留守","era_scope":["afterstory"],"source":"作者裁决 2026-08-14（审查裁决汇总 批4）","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-8031","relation_kind":"event.participant",